-- u8
load was 250 now 250
store 255 was 255 now 255
add 1 wraps was 255 now 0
sub 1 wraps was 0 now 255
and 15 was 255 now 15
or 48 was 15 now 63
xor 255 was 63 now 192
swap 7 was 192 now 7
compareSwap 7 to 9 saw 7 stored now 9
compareSwap 7 to 11 saw 9 kept now 9
-- i32
load was -5 now -5
add 12 was -5 now 7
sub 20 was 7 now -13
and 6 was -13 now 2
or 9 was 2 now 11
xor 3 was 11 now 8
add 1 wraps was 2147483647 now -2147483648
compareSwap 0 to 1 saw -2147483648 kept now -2147483648
compareSwap min to 1 saw -2147483648 stored now 1
-- u64
add 5 was 4294967296 now 4294967301
sub 1 was 4294967301 now 4294967300
swap 3 was 4294967300 now 3
load was 3 now 3
compareSwap 3 to 2^32 saw 3 stored now 4294967296
-- usize
add 1 was 0 now 1
add 1 was 1 now 2
sub 2 was 2 now 0
or 12 was 0 now 12
xor 4 was 12 now 8
and 24 was 8 now 8
compareSwap 1 to 2 saw 8 kept now 8
-- Bool
load was 0 now 0
or true was 0 now 1
xor true was 1 now 0
swap true was 0 now 1
and false was 1 now 0
store true was 1 now 1
compareSwap true to false saw 1 stored now 0
compareSwap true to false saw 0 kept now 0
-- *i64
load reaches 1
swap answered 1, slot reaches 2
compareSwap expecting c saw 1 kept now 1
compareSwap expecting a saw 1 stored now 2
